# pub falls back to .gitignore only inside a git repository, and this tree is
# not one yet, so what must stay out of the archive is listed here.
.dart_tool/
build/
example/build/
example/.dart_tool/
example/ios/Pods/
example/macos/Pods/
example/android/.gradle/
example/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
example/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# The example's weights, and the photograph it tests them on. 1.3 MB that
# every `pub get` of this package would otherwise pay for, to run one example
# — and the README says the weights are not distributed with the package, so
# shipping them here contradicted it. A checkout has them; a copy from pub.dev
# starts on the fallback engine and the home screen says so, with where to get
# them. See example/assets/models/README.md.
example/assets/models/*.tflite
example/assets/test/qr_photo.jpg
